{"track":"r","category":"기초 문법","level":2,"title":"요일 종류 (switch)","desc":"<p>요일 이름(<code>\"Mon\"</code>, <code>\"Tue\"</code>, …, <code>\"Sun\"</code>)을 받아, 토요일(<code>\"Sat\"</code>)과 일요일(<code>\"Sun\"</code>)이면 <code>\"weekend\"</code>, 나머지는 <code>\"weekday\"</code>를 돌려주는 <code>day_type(day)</code>를 만드세요. <code>switch()</code>를 써 보세요.</p>","solution":"day_type <- function(day) {\n  switch(day,\n    \"Sat\" = ,\n    \"Sun\" = \"weekend\",\n    \"weekday\")\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>switch(값, 이름1 = 결과1, ..., 기본값)</code>. 결과를 비워 두면(<code>\"Sat\" = ,</code>) 다음 항목의 결과를 함께 써요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"day_type(\"Mon\")","expected":"weekday","visible":true},{"call":"day_type(\"Sat\")","expected":"weekend","visible":true},{"call":"day_type(\"Sun\")","expected":"weekend","visible":false},{"call":"day_type(\"Fri\")","expected":"weekday","visible":false}],"starter":"day_type <- function(day) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-307"}